        "name": "USN-6784-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that cJSON incorrectly handled certain input. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause cJSON to crash, resulting in a denial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 22.04 LTS and Ubuntu 23.10. (CVE-2023-50471, CVE-2023-50472)  Luo Jin discovered that cJSON incorrectly handled certain input. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause cJSON to crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2024-31755)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2023-50471",
          "CVE-2023-50472",
          "CVE-2024-31755"
        ]
      },
